# Milestone 12 — Packaging & Branding

Read **docs/milestones/m12/M12_GLOBAL_RULES.md** before any M12 task.

## Hard constraints

- **Do NOT** redesign Desktop or Flutter UI (layouts, workflows, navigation).
- **Do NOT** rewrite completed business modules — extend with build config, assets, scripts only.
- **Release artifacts only:** Windows Setup.exe, macOS DMG, Android APK, iOS Release/IPA config.
- **No** Play Store or App Store publishing assets.
- **Branding:** WEBSTUDIO dark logo on white — source from `apps/desktop/public/assets/webstudio/`.
- DB changes require safe Alembic migrations; maintain backward compatibility.

## Allowed changes

- `electron-builder` / installer config
- Flutter launcher icons & native splash (asset generation)
- Version bump scripts, CI `release.yml`
- Production env gates (demo mode, CSP)
- Documentation in `docs/milestones/m12/`

